      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "TAX ZUCKERBERG, FUND KICK-ASS LOCAL JOURNALISTS \n\nmattdpearce.substack.com/p/c\u2026",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/mattdpearce/status/1878607938547585212",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-13T01:00:10+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "Interesting take on why news is broken that makes a lot of sense and seems intuitively correct when you read it.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mitndqe2hs2x",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-06T16:04:47.172Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "#Artemis II lunar flyby images are showing up! \ud83d\ude0d\n\nA crescent Earth setting behind the Moon.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mivuqgwezs2f",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-07T13:22:29.161Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "And here\u2019s the eclipse photo from Artemis II. I am in tears.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mivt4ru6ts2k",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-07T12:53:35.794Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "\u201cStocks were mixed on the news\u2026\u201d",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mivtfjgcac2x",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-07T12:58:28.930Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "Believe it or not, this was peak AI summarization. This is basically AGI",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3miv46rhaif2z",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-07T06:03:05.324Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "\u201cThere is a fundamental conflict between the efficiency with which markets spread information and the incentives to acquire information.\u201d",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mitwu5w7pc2q",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:55:01.946Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "Subscribed. I can't afford to eat out as much as I used to, but I can afford to support good food journalism.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mitvndefrk2v",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-06T18:33:19.028Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "v v v v good @mattdpearce.com joint here",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mitnqsttj22d",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-06T16:12:05.974Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "brb printing \u201cfull public intellectual\u201d on all my business cards",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mitndol65s2p",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-06T16:04:45.308Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "big homie @mattdpearce.com going full public intellectual and i am very much in support of this",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mitmyghwyk2a",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-06T15:58:27.714Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "This is much more interesting than I expected.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mitlis5vjs23",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-06T15:31:49.355Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "To the youth seeking to understand the news collapse, I say: read theory \n\nmattdpearce.substack.com/p/the-simple...",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mirvicub3227",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-05T23:25:11.252Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "To the youth seeking to understand the news collapse, I say: read theory \n\nmattdpearce.substack.com/p/the-simple...",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mirvicub3227",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-05T23:25:11.252Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "There are 2 kinds of people - those who can\u2019t believe Andy Samberg married some random musician, and those who can\u2019t believe Joanna Newsom married some random comedian. Both of these people are married to each other.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3miraztgvis2c",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-05T17:19:10.487Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "\"Easter: The Lord is Risen\" by African American artist & illustrator Allan Rohan Crite, who suffused his work with deep religious feeling and is now featured in an exhibition at Rutgers University's Zimmerli Art Museum, through late July zimmerli.rutgers.edu/art/exhibiti...",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mirbgcgb622u",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-05T17:26:08.845Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "It\u2019s called \u201cGollumizing\u201d",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mioqh3jqk2qk",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-04T17:17:02.089Z",
      "type": "post"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "matt-pearce",
      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "Lot of recalled products down there.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattdpearce.com/post/3mim2o4l33c2i",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-03T15:41:56.260Z",
